{
  "openapi" : "3.1.0",
  "info" : {
    "description" : "Session-cookie API for the Online Order web client. Sign in with a form POST to /login\n(username, password); the SESSION cookie authenticates later calls.\n\nErrors are JSON: {\"error\": \"<CODE>\", \"message\": \"...\"}. Codes include OUT_OF_STOCK,\nPRICE_CHANGED (with total_cents), MIXED_RESTAURANTS, EMPTY_CART, STATUS_CHANGED,\nTOO_LATE_TO_CANCEL, IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED, VALIDATION_FAILED (with fields),\nEMAIL_TAKEN and RATE_LIMITED (429, with Retry-After).\n\nPOST /orders takes an Idempotency-Key header: reuse it when retrying the same\ncheckout and the server replays the first result instead of placing a second order.",
    "license" : {
      "name" : "MIT"
    },
    "title" : "Online Order API",
    "version" : "1"
  },
  "security" : [ {
    "session" : [ ]
  } ],
